# Intentionally near-empty.
#
# The Carepatron workflow env vars that used to live here (ClickUp ids, PR reviewer,
# branch prefix, Slack notify channel) moved to Carepatron-App/.devcontainer/config.local,
# which is gitignored and per-developer.  Do NOT re-add them: install.sh copies this file
# to ~/.zshrc.local, which zsh reads *after* /etc/zsh/zshrc, so anything set here would
# override that per-developer file.
#
# Secrets (CLICKUP_API_KEY, etc.) still come via remoteEnv in Cursor/VS Code user settings.
